! MULTIPLOT demo: a page of subplots for the Cooke triplet, after the
! layout of a textbook design summary (wave fans, ray fans, spot through
! focus, MTF, MTF through focus).
! After it draws, change the lens (e.g. THI S6 ...) to see the page redraw.
RES osdtriplet
FFO -0.1
IFO 0.025
NFO 5
MULTIPLOT 3 2 'Triplet at paraxial focus'
SUBPLOT 1 1
RIM ; WFR Y ; GO
SUBPLOT 1 2
RIM ; GO
SUBPLOT 2 1 1 2
SPO THF ; ORI H ; GO
SUBPLOT 3 1
MTF ; MFR 200 ; IFR 10 ; GO
SUBPLOT 3 2
MTF THF ; FRE 100 ; GO
GO
